  "title": "Super Simple Oven-Barbequed Chicken",
  "description": "Chicken roasted in the oven with liquid smoke, Worcestershire, herbs, and spices is much easier than — and gives almost the same results as — cooking it on the grill.",
  "authors": [
    "O. Romaine"
  ],
